  "body_html": "<h1>gibbard_satterthwaite</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem gibbard_satterthwaite [Fintype N] [Nonempty N] [Fintype A] [Nonempty A] (hA : Fintype.card A ≥ 3) (f : VotingRule N A) (hf_total : IsTotal f) (hf_res : Resolute f) (hU : Unanimity f) (hSP : ResoluteStrategyproofness f hf_res) : Dictatorial f</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>VotingRule</li>\n<li>IsTotal</li>\n<li>Resolute</li>\n<li>Unanimity</li>\n<li>ResoluteStrategyproofness</li>\n<li>Dictatorial</li>\n<li>muller_satterthwaite</li>\n<li>strategyproof_monotonic</li>\n</ul>",
